    <td class="ellipsisize">
              This project was supported by the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA), National Ocean Service (NOS), Office of Response and Restoration (OR&amp;R), Emergency Response Division (ERD), Seattle, Washington.
          </td>
  </tr>
                </table>
